    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following sales lead and score its quality.\n\nLead ID: {{ $json[\"Lead ID\"] }}\nName: {{ $json[\"Full Name\"] }}\nEmail: {{ $json[\"Email\"] }}\nPhone: {{ $json[\"Phone Number\"] }}\nCompany: {{ $json[\"Company Name\"] }}\nBusiness Requirement: {{ $json[\"Business Requirement\"] }}\nLead Source: {{ $json[\"Lead Source\"] }}\nEstimated Budget:{{ $json['Estimated Budget'] }} \nExpected Timeline: {{ $json[\"Expected Timeline\"] }}\n\nAnalyze the lead and return ONLY the structured output requested by the output parser.\n\nAI Score must be a number from 0 to 100.\nLead Category must be exactly one of:\n- Hot\n- Warm\n- Cold\n\nReason must be a short explanation.\n\nDo not return Markdown.\nDo not wrap the response in ```json.\nDo not return any text outside the structured output.\n\nScoring:\n- 80-100 = Hot\n- 50-79 = Warm\n- 0-49 = Cold\n\nConsider budget, urgency, business requirement, and lead source when scoring.\n\nAnalyze the sales lead and return the result using the required structured output format.\n\nScoring:\n- 80–100 = Hot\n- 50–79 = Warm\n- 0–49 = Cold\n\nConsider:\n1. Business requirement quality\n2. Estimated budget\n3. Timeline\n4. Lead source\n5. Whether the requirement appears genuine and professional\n\nDo not invent information.\nReturn only the required structured fields.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
